{"Name": "VX2776-4K-mhd", "Natural": "Whether for office use or enjoying entertainment at home, the ViewSonic&reg; VX2776-4K-mhd is designed to take your viewing experience to another level. With a SuperClear&reg; IPS panel and a sleek frameless design, this monitor provides a near-seamless viewing experience that&#39;s ideal for multi-monitor setups. Stunning 4K Ultra HD resolution generates 4-times more pixels than Full HD monitors, which boosts efficiency and image detail to enhance both work and play. A mega dynamic contrast ratio of 80M:1 delivers more image depth for a better user experience, while HDR10 content support results in vivid colours and brightness that exceed that of standard monitors. Built-in HDMI and DisplayPort inputs offer flexible connectivity options for a wide range of devices.Discover Amazing Details with Ultra HD PerformanceThe VX2776-4K-mhd has an Ultra HD 3840 x 2160 resolution that is 4x higher than Full HD. This results in greater image detail and more on-screen content. The dazzling images and marvellous details make the VX2776-4K-mhd a truly immersive masterpiece.&nbsp;4K UHD3840 x 2160&nbsp;HDR10 Delivers Stellar Contrast and Colour AccuracyThe VX2776-4K-mhd is compatible with the industry standard HDR10 high dynamic range, so colour, brightness, and contrast are more defined and exceed the capabilities of ordinary monitors.HDR10&nbsp;Clarity From Any AngleEnjoy accurate and vivid colours with consistent levels of brightness no matter your vantage point. With SuperClear&reg; IPS panel technology, the monitor delivers the same image quality whether you are looking at the screen from above, below, the front, or the side.SuperClear IPS178&deg;/178&deg;&nbsp;Premium DesignThe monitor takes on an architecturally inspired design aesthetic fused with modern form factors such as a thin profile, frameless bezel, and unique triangular stand.ThinprofileFramelessbezelChrome triangularstand&nbsp;Billions of ColoursBy utilising 10-bit (8 bit+FRC) colour, the VX2776-4K-mhd is able to produce a colour palette of over one billion colours, resulting in richer, more vivid colour reproduction, smoother gradients, and a more natural transition between hues.10-bit(8 bit+FRC) colour&nbsp;Flexible ConnectivityA DisplayPort and two HDMI inputs offer a wide range of compatibility, giving you flexibility when connecting your devices.&nbsp;DisplayPortHDMI x 2&nbsp;ViewMode Optimised SettingsViewSonic&rsquo;s ViewMode includes optimised &ldquo;Game&rdquo;, &ldquo;Movie&rdquo;, &ldquo;Web&rdquo;, &ldquo;Text&rdquo;, &ldquo;Mono&rdquo;, and &ldquo;Mac&rdquo; presets. Each preset offers specialised enhancements to gamma curve, colour temperature, contrast, and brightness to deliver the optimal viewing experience for different applications.GameMovieWebTextMacMono&nbsp;Eye Care TechnologyFlicker-Free Technology and Blue Light Filter minimise eyestrain over extended viewing periods.Blue Light FilterFlicker-Free&nbsp;Dual Integrated SpeakersDesigned with dual integrated speakers, this monitor combines incredible screen performance with stereo sound for an immersive multimedia experience.2.5W x 2&nbsp;Low Energy ConsumptionViewSonic&rsquo;s energy efficient Eco-Mode adjusts brightness to the optimal setting to reduce power consumption and eye fatigue while also prolonging the monitor&rsquo;s lifespan.ECO-Mode&nbsp;VESA CompatibilityInstall the monitor anywhere you like; using the VESA-compatible mount gives you added flexibility to fit your needs.100 x 100mm&nbsp;"}
{"Name": "TD2455", "Natural": "With responsive in-cell touch technology and an advanced ergonomic design, the ViewSonic\u00ae TD2455 touch monitor delivers hands-on control for more productive workspaces and collaborative classrooms. With high-performance in-cell touch technology, this 24\u201d (23.8\u201d viewable) Full HD display provides smooth and responsive touch tracking, along with amazing screen performance, within a sleek and bezel-less design. USB Type-C connectivity offers a single-cable plug-and-play solution for laptops, while DisplayPort output enables easy screen mirroring or extended desktops ideal for office productivity and podium touch applications such as conference rooms or classrooms. A magnetic stylus pen lets you write or draw on screen, and easily attaches to the display stand for secure storage. So whether used on its own on office desktops, as a presentation station in corporate meeting spaces, or as a front-of-classroom interactive teaching hub, the TD2455 helps to boost efficiency and productivity. *Some laptops may need to enter BIOS mode and change the power management setting to \u201ctap-to-wake\u201d.Versatile Touch ApplicationsWhether used as a check-in kiosk at reception, as a collaboration station with co-workers and colleagues at the office, or as a touch podium for front-facing teaching, this sleek and slim touch display seamlessly integrates into your workflow for boosted efficiency and productivity.Agile yet Scalable Touch Display Efficient MultitaskingWith advanced DisplayPort Multi-Stream technology and support for up to 4-screen daisy chaining*, this display can transform into the ultimate touch screen workstation \u2013 in mirror and extended modes \u2013 for increased productivity. *up to 4 with a PC; up to 3 with a laptopDisplayPort Multi-Stream Transport (MST) Touch Annotation for PresentationsAn included stylus pen easily attaches to the magnetic base of the display, and allows you to draw, write notes, or perform other detailed tasks that require more accuracy than your fingertips alone. The pen is especially useful during presentations when the TD2455 is attached to a projector.Fine Writing Stylus Accurate yet Smooth Touch ExperiencePowered by in-cell touch technology, the TD2455 offers sensitive yet smooth touch response for detailed content editing with fingertips or the touch pen.10-Point In-Cell Projected Capacitive (PCAP) Touch Technology Quickly Start Your WorkThe latest USB Type-C input transforms this display into a powerful hub by enabling easy connectivity to PC, laptop, and Chrome systems. In addition, it delivers charging power, video, and audio over a single cable.USB Type-C Comfortable Working AnglesDesigned with an ergonomically advanced dual-hinge stand, this display can be tilted and adjusted to deliver a more comfortable user experience.Ergonomic Dual-Hinge Design Incredible Images, Sleek DesignWith high-performance in-cell touch technology, this display provides smooth and responsive touch tracking, along with amazing screen performance, within a sleek and bezel-less design.In-Cell Projected Capacitive (PCAP) Touch Technology Minimal Design ConceptThe ergonomic stand features an integrated client mount for quick installation of optional mini PC mount on the back of the display. Cable management features also keep your workspace neat.Optional Mini PC Mount Touch support with Windows, Android, Chrome, Linux and Raspberry Pi Extra FeaturesVESA compatibility, low energy consumption with Energy Star, SuperClear\u00ae IPS technology, blue light filter, and flicker-free Dimensions & I/O Ports Menu ControlsVESA Compatible(Wall Mount 100x100mm)Internal SpeakersAC INHDMIDP INUSB Type CDP OUT(Output/MST daisy chain)Audio OutUSB up stream"}
